[{"client_msg_id":"dafe475d-2d10-4996-aba6-9e3f16aa3650","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"消える場所決めるだけなら普通の塗りつぶしなんで…再帰になる。点数計算を正しくってなるとクラスターの区別が居るので再帰の再帰、もしくは再帰+連結リスト的なクラスター管理機構がいる。ってのが当時の僕の結論でした。","ts":"1615438721.020300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+4j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9bc69e9e-6d37-402b-bca7-c390d9c56953","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ふーむ、なるほど、一理あるのかあ","ts":"1615438030.017200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b0oP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad3f969d-0d28-4955-9e30-6721623edcb3","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ちなみにキレイな解放はまだ思いつけてない。","ts":"1615437877.016900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KbI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"837060a1-d81a-4544-868e-faab84888b56","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ぷよぷよ、セルオートマトン的に連結計算するとちょっと複雑になるんですよ。特にオフィシャルな点数計算を再現しようとすると。","ts":"1615437840.016100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2xY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b842bcd7-09c0-4dae-b38b-e364bc348236","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/Collabora/status/1369719352019345409\u003e 延命する OpenGL","ts":"1615436071.014100","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/Collabora|@Collabora\u003e: One year ago, we announced a new partnership with \u003chttps://twitter.com/Microsoft|@Microsoft\u003e to build #OpenGL mapping layers to #DirectX 12. Today, we're excited to share that the we have passed the OpenGL 3.3 conformance tests \u0026amp; have now upstreamed the #D3D12 driver in Mesa! \u003chttps://col.la/ogldxu\u003e #OpenSource \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/EwI3NtBXYAg1PzB.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"Collabora","author_subname":"@Collabora","author_link":"https://twitter.com/Collabora/status/1369719352019345409","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1151965279905357829/WVg1qgFW_normal.png","text":"One year ago, we announced a new partnership with \u003chttps://twitter.com/Microsoft|@Microsoft\u003e to build #OpenGL mapping layers to #DirectX 12. Today, we're excited to share that the we have passed the OpenGL 3.3 conformance tests \u0026amp; have now upstreamed the #D3D12 driver in Mesa! \u003chttps://col.la/ogldxu\u003e #OpenSource \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/EwI3NtBXYAg1PzB.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/EwI3NtBXYAg1PzB.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1615401516,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/Collabora/status/1369719352019345409","original_url":"https://twitter.com/Collabora/status/1369719352019345409"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KaP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"640684d7-29b3-48c5-a221-ef00a766bbd3","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"そういえば日経ソフトウェアかなんかの特集でぷよぷよを作ってみようみたいなものありましたよね","ts":"1615435894.013900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8sGr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48c6af82-8a5a-4a0c-b077-66793fcb415a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"煽りプログラミングは方向性を見失いやすく、大変危険です","ts":"1615435603.012900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":3,"users":["U03C6TEAZ","U06ECBRTJ","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zJb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0729b468-9374-420a-92d8-423f101540cb","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"煽らなければいいのに。","ts":"1615435557.012100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U81LLJ340"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks"